===Etymology===
From {{etyl|xno}} {{term|apurtenance|lang=xno}}, from {{etyl|fro}} {{term|apartenance|lang=fro}} (Modern {{fr}} {{term|appartenance|lang=fr}}), from {{term|apertenir|lang=fro}} (Modern {{fr}} {{term|appartenir|lang=fr}})

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# an [[appendage]] added to something else
# {{in plural}} [[equipment]] used for some specific [[task]]; [[gear]]
# minor [[property]] (such as an [[outhouse]]) that passes with the main property when it is [[sold]]
# the thing to which another [[pertain|pertains]].

